# Station event descriptions. Conditions and limits are shown separately in the admin event viewer.

ent-AnomalySpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a random anomaly at a location on the main station grid.

ent-BluespaceArtifact =
    .desc = Materializes a random artifact on the station with a bluespace flash.

ent-BluespaceLocker =
    .desc = Turns an eligible locker without access restrictions into a bluespace locker linked to another locker on the same map.

ent-BreakerFlip =
    .desc = Switches off several active APC breakers on a random station, cutting local power until the breakers are restored.

ent-BureaucraticError =
    .desc = Changes job vacancies for late arrivals on a random station. It can adjust several job limits or make one job unlimited while closing other finite positions.

ent-ClericalError =
    .desc = Deletes a random selection of crew records from a station database.

ent-ClosetSkeleton =
    .desc = Spawns a closet skeleton in a randomly selected eligible storage container.

ent-ClownSwarm =
    .desc = Sends waves of clown-themed meteors toward the station.

ent-CockroachMigration =
    .desc = Spawns cockroaches and related variants from station vents.

ent-CowSwarm =
    .desc = Sends waves of cow-themed meteors toward the station.

ent-DerelictEngineerCyborgSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a derelict engineering cyborg ghost role near the station.

ent-DerelictGenericCyborgSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a derelict standard cyborg ghost role near the station.

ent-DerelictJanitorCyborgSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a derelict janitorial cyborg ghost role near the station.

ent-DerelictMedicalCyborgSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a derelict medical cyborg ghost role near the station.

ent-DerelictMiningCyborgSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a derelict mining cyborg ghost role near the station.

ent-DerelictSyndicateAssaultCyborgSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a derelict Syndicate assault cyborg ghost role near the station.

ent-DragonSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a space dragon ghost role near the station, with objectives to open carp rifts and survive.

ent-FunSwarm =
    .desc = Sends a mixed swarm of clown, cow, potato and Urist-themed meteors toward the station.

ent-GasLeak =
    .desc = Leaks a randomly selected gas at a station location. A spark at the end of the leak can ignite flammable gas.

ent-GiftsEngineering =
    .desc = Adds approved cargo gift orders for engineering materials, cables, an airlock kit and vending restocks.

ent-GiftsFireProtection =
    .desc = Adds approved cargo gift orders with firefighting equipment and burn and trauma treatment kits.

ent-GiftsJanitor =
    .desc = Adds approved cargo gift orders with cleaning supplies, replacement lights and janitorial protective gear.

ent-GiftsMedical =
    .desc = Adds approved cargo gift orders with medical and chemistry supplies, treatment kits and protective gear.

ent-GiftsPizzaPartyLarge =
    .desc = Adds a larger approved cargo gift order of pizza and soft drinks for the bar.

ent-GiftsPizzaPartySmall =
    .desc = Adds an approved cargo gift order of pizza and soft drinks for the bar.

ent-GiftsSecurityGuns =
    .desc = Adds approved cargo gift orders with armor and lethal weapons for security.

ent-GiftsSecurityRiot =
    .desc = Adds approved cargo gift orders with riot equipment, restraints and nonlethal weapons for security.

ent-GiftsSpacingSupplies =
    .desc = Adds approved cargo gift orders with EVA equipment, inflatable barriers, oxygen and emergency medical supplies.

ent-GiftsVendingRestock =
    .desc = Adds approved cargo gift orders with refill crates for several station vending machines.

ent-GreytideVirus =
    .desc = Compromises selected access groups on a station, unlocking lockers and opening and bolting accessible airlocks. External access is excluded.

ent-ImmovableRodSpawn =
    .desc = Launches an immovable rod through a random station location, damaging obstacles in its path. The rod can have a special themed variant.

ent-IonStorm =
    .desc = Applies ion-storm law changes to susceptible silicon entities on a randomly selected station.

ent-KingRatMigration =
    .desc = Spawns mice from station vents and can introduce a Rat King ghost role.

ent-KudzuGrowth =
    .desc = Plants kudzu at a random station location, where it can spread into surrounding areas.

ent-LoneOpsSpawn =
    .desc = Introduces a lone nuclear operative aboard the Striker shuttle, using nuclear operative rules and objectives.

ent-MassHallucinations =
    .desc = Temporarily gives eligible humanoid characters auditory hallucinations, making them hear sounds that are not actually nearby.

ent-MeteorSwarmLarge =
    .desc = Sends waves with a large share of medium and large meteors toward the station.

ent-MeteorSwarmMedium =
    .desc = Sends waves dominated by medium meteors, with some small and large meteors, toward the station.

ent-MeteorSwarmSmall =
    .desc = Sends waves of mostly small meteors, mixed with medium meteors, toward the station.

ent-MouseMigration =
    .desc = Spawns mice from station vents, with a chance of unusual mouse variants.

ent-NinjaSpawn =
    .desc = Introduces a space ninja antagonist with research theft and sabotage objectives.

ent-ParadoxCloneSpawn =
    .desc = Creates an antagonist duplicate of a selected character. The clone must eliminate the original and survive.

ent-PotatoSwarm =
    .desc = Sends waves of potato-themed meteors toward the station.

ent-PowerGridCheck =
    .desc = Temporarily shuts down APC breakers on the main station grid, blocks manual reactivation during the check, then restores affected breakers.

ent-RandomCritterHorde =
    .desc = Announces vent creatures but releases a group of small critters such as mice, cockroaches or snails from a single vent.

ent-RandomSentience =
    .desc = Makes selected eligible station creatures or objects available as sentient ghost roles.

ent-RevenantSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns a revenant at a random station location for a ghost to control.

ent-SleeperAgents =
    .desc = Activates selected crew members as sleeper traitors and announces an intercepted transmission.

ent-SlimesSpawnHorde =
    .desc = Releases a group of hostile adult slimes from a single station vent.

ent-SmugglerStashVariationPass =
    .desc = Places a random satchel stash spawner at a random station location.

ent-SnailMigration =
    .desc = Spawns snails from station vents, with a very rare chance of an instant-death snail.

ent-SnailMigrationLowPop =
    .desc = Spawns ordinary and unusual snails from station vents, without the instant-death snail variant.

ent-SnakeSpawnHorde =
    .desc = Releases a group of snakes, potentially including space cobras, from a single station vent.

ent-SolarFlare =
    .desc = Disrupts headset communications on common and selected department channels. It can also break light bulbs and toggle airlocks.

ent-SpaceChangelingSpawn =
    .desc = Spawns an elder headslug changeling ghost role in space, with objectives involving devouring victims, killing and escaping.

ent-SpaceDustMajor =
    .desc = Sends a larger shower of space dust toward the station from multiple directions, with an advance announcement.

ent-SpaceDustMinor =
    .desc = Sends a small unannounced shower of space dust toward the station from multiple directions.

ent-SpiderClownSpawnHorde =
    .desc = Releases a group of clown spiders from a single station vent.

ent-SpiderSpawnHorde =
    .desc = Releases a group of hostile giant spiders from a single station vent.

ent-UnknownShuttleHonki =
    .desc = Introduces the Honki shuttle with clown visitor roles and announces an incoming unknown shuttle.

ent-UnknownShuttleInstigator =
    .desc = Introduces the Instigator shuttle with Syndicate soldier and team leader roles.

ent-UnknownShuttleManOWar =
    .desc = Introduces the Man O War shuttle with Cossack ghost roles.

ent-UnknownShuttleNTQuark =
    .desc = Introduces the NT Quark shuttle with command and cargo visitor roles.

ent-UnknownShuttleSyndieEvacPod =
    .desc = Introduces a Syndicate evacuation pod with roles for Syndicate disaster survivors.

ent-UristSwarm =
    .desc = Sends waves of Urist-themed meteors toward the station.

ent-VentClog =
    .desc = Releases chemical foam from some station vents. Reagents are randomized and can include dangerous chemicals.

ent-WizardSpawn =
    .desc = Introduces a wizard antagonist using the wizard rule and its ghost-role selection.

ent-ZombieOutbreak =
    .desc = Selects initial infected characters to begin a zombie outbreak among the crew.
